  "rationale": [
    "Violet + yellow are near-complementary: maximum energy with only two hues.",
    "Neutrals tinted violet so the hard ink shadows belong to the brand.",
    "Bigger UI ratio (1.25) and display from 32: playful products need bold hierarchy."
